@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = {{customerToken}}

### ====================================================================
### CUSTOMERS MODULE TESTS
### ====================================================================

### Test: Get My Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test: Get My Documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/me/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test: Get My Subscriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/me/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test: Get My Invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/me/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
